# PTM structure types of a snapshot, independent of the potential (pair_style zero only builds
# neighbours): strict (rmsd 0.12) to confirm that liquids are disordered, loose (0.2) to confirm
# that crystals near their melting point keep their structure.
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
read_data       ${dfile}
pair_style      zero 8.0
pair_coeff      * *
mass            * 1.0
compute         strict all ptm/atom default 0.12
compute         loose all ptm/atom default 0.2
dump            1 all custom 1 ${out} id c_strict[1] c_loose[1]
dump_modify     1 sort id
run             0
